// PostApiSlosOriginOrIdReset Restart the error budget window of a specific SLO
//
// Starts a new error budget window for the SLO, beginning now. The definition is left
// unchanged, and the measurement starts from scratch: everything recorded before the reset,
// including any incident, stops counting against the objective.
//
// The SLO records a new series from this point on, so the budget reported right after a reset
// covers only the elapsed part of the time window and widens as the window fills up again.
// Data recorded by the previous series is kept.
