// PostApiSlosOriginOrIdResetWithResponse Restart the error budget window of a specific SLO
//
// Starts a new error budget window for the SLO, beginning now. The definition is left
// unchanged, and the measurement starts from scratch: everything recorded before the reset,
// including any incident, stops counting against the objective.
